# The Beast Within (battlefield.beast_within#helper, Jade Sepulcher): a party at _1v0: main (a level 75 Blue Mage at
# level cap 75, The Beast Within accepted at Quest[6][40]Prog 2 (GMs), one Blue Mage's Testimony) enters area 1 (33) by
# the testimony: TESTIMONY_WEARS (3 shown, 2 left). The members by the trigger, no trade: bob (completed) and cat
# (accepted, Quest[6][40]Prog 3) each get the 32000 menu (0,0,0,4); each update 33: REQS_NOT_MET (5); finished: not
# entered (one player to a battlefield). dan (accepted, Quest[6][40]Prog 0) gets only the door's default
# (DefaultActions.lua messageSpecial -1, shown as 32767), no menu; his update and finish-if-event find no event.
